# A05 result

A05 is preserved as `STOP_CANDIDATE_SETUP_KEY_NOT_ALLOWLISTED`. The durable event channel worked: it recorded `input_owner_process_ready`. The candidate then attempted `w`, which the owner RPC allowlist rejects, so the session never recorded an armed hold and no input-admission or recovery hypothesis was tested.

